# data/ — seed files, reference lookups, export templates
# Ignore any sensitive or generated data files; track folder structure and safe reference files only.

# Ignore raw data dumps and exports
*.csv
*.tsv
*.xlsx
*.xls
*.json
*.xml
*.sql
*.bak

# Ignore local databases
*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.mdf
*.ldf

# Ignore generated/exported PDFs and reports
*.pdf

# Always track this file and any markdown reference docs
!.gitignore
!*.md
